Publish-11910 1 failed of 3, 'Publish must not go around the held widget: … called 1 times'. The first C attempt was a no-op (replacement contained in anchor; the tool refused, 'the replacement count moved 1 -> 1'), re-run with a landing replacement. No dist/ involved: vitest resolves the workspace from src, and the changed modules are app-shell source imported relatively. Live 17.7.0 server reading: NOT MEASURED, reason: no published server installed here; the spec parse is the measurement and matches the card's live 422 paths.",
